{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1452,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce327ade2712adf82d02d9f0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节……快乐？",
      "source_fingerprint": "41727f74e5dfe8a539f3767bed7a921050c908c5cf90de7f9f7d5add5a01056a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b757b9a96dddf7720cc66e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节……快乐？",
      "source_fingerprint": "41727f74e5dfe8a539f3767bed7a921050c908c5cf90de7f9f7d5add5a01056a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ff7f5778fbf2531b6c9ba23",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我很难答应突发性的邀约……\r\n我明明就对太阳\r\n说过好几次了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb476a3f3e94910282ba934d5e2f02204f6506dbdf2fee3a8796e9ac1898be35",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0be063b3c898c9244aaaadad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "「华丽一族」……当中的成员\r\n都是配得上这名号的高贵人士。\r\n所以我也必须站上巅峰。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d24184abec07e6ca9b0ccb072269d41c3d5f42631ed49e26120c1cd9642cf43",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5181afeb253c6d2fc86a7db3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "母亲跟奶奶都在比赛中\r\n立下了丰功伟业。要证明\r\n我的血统……就只能靠比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c34ffa449d9f15303483923f685be1678d8f9ad2602acdd78d2745eab59cfd94",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b8d826e6fb8589ac63a66be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我在常光顾的水果店订货，\r\n寄给爱吃香蕉的奇迹……\r\n好像害她感到很惶恐。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bec87fd75a6a935e6d682a0cd85695906bd7e81d2112f9bd9f54bf9343fb8d55",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd4500efa688beb9a99f4dec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "老家的莎菲……家里养的狗\r\n非常聪明，它能理解送来的报纸\r\n该递给谁，并且叼过去给他。",
      "source_fingerprint": "73a112f66192d9add9e4c8e0999e812348c518fded25560e7a969349158e2d01",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5a67b4ce08eff7f14fd8e7b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "服装同时蕴含着符号的功能。\r\n既然有胜者舞台，穿着华丽\r\n成为目光焦点也是必须的吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d12bfce4da1aa7c2fdf792f09e301ac48499f5599bd315073db029d83beef542",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d608d8519871d09f59fd775d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家穿相同的服装虽然不稀奇，\r\n但对太阳来说似乎是宝贵的体验。\r\n她还请人帮我们拍照留念。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e123f397ec4549d37522668bded79dd7824eaa1a0020375647e6026c17053333",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8eb1bbf09f69830544ad7178",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我挑选的这件衣服\r\n是在品格、机能性以及设计面上，\r\n都符合了标准的最佳解答。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2e611c45d9157f903ab6a3309226c3a1e8dca3ab7d772f01dd63d73c2bc9172",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb3909451509ed146f55709b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "红色蝴蝶结，还有领带……\r\n这颜色中蕴藏了我的决心，\r\n象征着我必定会展现出色的成果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e404a7f97f32bc58f3a82b8364142462a0f55045b2289f9a4474cd616a06434d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33054628f6845f9cab78cfd7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我早上常常在\r\n校门口看到青竹。\r\n她对工作真是充满热忱呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bca6aab5592110a89151cbdfa9edb0d87cf2f3dee4c1fd4f41801f5dbee1567a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92efb9fdc3deb5986b46e235",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我有时候会被问到这个问题，\r\n但要女仆代劳的只有一小部分。\r\n我可以自己顺利完成所有准备。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a7cbfbd252421468f2ed86660164d2f0f26e8af2b6fa2c06d273a898c57f892",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba5e6cfc28789d957b77da43",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我在就寝前会诵读家族的金科玉律。\r\n这是我用来反省一天中的言行举止，\r\n是否有辱家族名声的宝贵时间。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a40eef3cada38c51480b8f8a008fd05c1856dab1b511c739f338e8ff3e4d397",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9aad69db14104f494ea1b0bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "春天时我会配戴花朵项链。\r\n毕竟符合时令的饰品，\r\n总是能透露出那个人的身份。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9dd0eab1c299ed8fc20551fe1e9e7062841ad9ee35940d5d15698f53a413535",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2380d884a033b26b5c3aa00c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即使是在酷暑之中，我也能在\r\n不流一滴汗的情况下完成职责。\r\n这是家族成员都该保持的格调。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc7457562de5d5d9a39ba3edd8983b156476d87e256b00ea64013237920a8e27",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3bdded38d4f2faa93ffb6179",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刚才我看到千明将自己整个人\r\n埋在了落叶堆里。她还是一样\r\n是个超出我理解范围的人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ca023f523c1323f57f7479aeae4dbc226257b10d868f6f561137475bace0ef4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43185a72e311988d48f68d8c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在严寒的早晨里，\r\n奇迹也迟迟无法起床。\r\n……刚睡醒时的声音也有点低沉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ceb0547179c92d4a511587c544007b8d1671e7490f9913feaee2851ab5486ef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bae30bf1b6ccbddf07da1d50",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然我无法理解您所说的大部分内容，\n但太阳神的热情确实让我感受到了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c60e63b6fa2c253c945f36886097b1b4f8dc7a0244bb66f1960c1ea9103d3943",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9a7b9968c088d11ace314a1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "奇迹的话意味深长，  \n似乎能让我有新的发现。也许我和她\n在视角上有什么不同吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6eb650b2adfa0ffde56d380c9c887ef28251e8930f072c29c93ae2dd8a1939ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79b5aba65533065f1199b602",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "从青竹身上，我感受到了一种\n贯彻自我正义的信念。\n这值得尊敬。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6aef18dad03438dec8942b1bb358f686982fd475a67b27b851c35052948592aa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea208058bcfbec0b4e9c65fd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "也文小姐习惯用风的名字来比喻事物，\n但只要考虑对话的前后文，\n还是可以推测出其含义的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf37fc2088222087f252b5dc9bc68158d5fad2a44e6c0b2c6378def3cd12b798",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e45e7391349e4cabb912919",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "严于律己，庄重度日。  \n那不过是提升自身的  \n日常生活罢了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "06de6be629f34c9622425f1377a1321b31e3098bd4902c7824f38e85e9d74009",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe523548f8fa2d9816b60888",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "正因如此，早晨才更要挺直腰背，\n端正自身姿态。……打哈欠之类\n的行为是绝对不允许的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee20c625679a623042d7f32b6e64cc276a043077622711e4efc60288b36a6eac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b504a2d831703d428ff4398c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无法吃午餐的日子，我会在空闲时间\n吃些轻食来保持平衡。这样一天的营\n养不会有问题。",
      "source_fingerprint": "87fbdac54738357195e28f8425fbd2da77087d2c3b794f1e61a64c97ba2911c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d760efaa88a77b1dc03c984",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最近，我经常做在轻快的音乐中跳舞\n的梦。打算作为形象训练，在现实中\n加以运用。",
      "source_fingerprint": "906ee8f294ea984bb4e9660272a4cd638a99f742168dc8e4e57b365948099ced",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:760fc886e2f6bc35e0e22893",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "春风得意，心绪纷乱之事  \n并不存在。在一年的开始，  \n唯有让身心更加紧绷。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e0bdcc181a0a80859da1781460f2a1ca0c7cd67ffd089f63b0c869594dc173f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf9aff98b6d04ee3e6962d47",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "青梅雨的璀璨光芒，  \n想必能活用于举手投足之间。  \n平日便须时刻铭记于心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f72257927cd5a7e0cfd46fa6e69d7025879e814ffef8a73297e39b573b3cabe9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6896dfa5518ecbb2f5bc91a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "到了山毛榉装扮的季节，经常会有人\n邀请我去徒步旅行……有时也会作为\n训练的一部分参加。",
      "source_fingerprint": "da5efec0955d92650330ce1fba368878dc6a5d37b0f9f9f84d266ff2ccdd4834",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45bc5965525a8910ec060b80",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "连寒夜中的群星也超越的\n光辉，尽归吾身……",
      "source_fingerprint": "40506d4310570fd2d11c9245599f506977d07ef411c2404f259607fc312fdd01",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6482ea3c1b4d2bd58d8c31fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『服装』也是自己的武器。  \n我会根据情况，选择最合适的  \n装备。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2676529097b18d38618a57931af4849e912f9d2c50f9d2c3d2dfd28e41817f5c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:90a511ae5b1518ef59b4d374",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "设计方面是由我亲自完成的。  \n关于时尚的事情，  \n也是社交中必备的教养呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "12264367a5469c9500ce13dc63ab7c28b095ae3408de3fc47d0cafcdc8b30a60",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0ac241f9e8c7b5dc2267601",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天也要请你多多指教了。\r\n在我达到与家族相称的基准前，\r\n还请彻底指导我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6392f6ce21c5d249b8a52af859de5ccd269b5323f6dabb2f3aebc8030debe7f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e39f5b6ebbc4f0ccf1f6bdc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "参上",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a1281566a536eb899dc047da232a71e4e151e0779da98a3707fbcb3e07f82b7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4fc5b5c6b09a407322073482",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "若要继承各位的威望，则必须付出\r\n比非凡水平……更甚的努力才行。\r\n以目前的体况而言，也将能够达成。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a50e0ce923c1e4fa0661d2d5e619cfbd42d97cf0dd8bdaba2d24661babf926b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03e100ab37881a8077f29a12",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想你应当确认过\r\n运动医学会的最新发表了。\r\n我们之后再来讨论吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f95af5511b7e290450e36a26c0ba84ce7cca2a5b2d060caf93e86dbbf7c77e8e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc8ccf05ed8684aaa1eb3006",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有些职责只能在比赛中完成。\r\n既然清楚己身的目的，\r\n就无须迷惘，只管向前迈进。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec3b7b01d2114c9696b08788cc17130e5932fbeb055dc6d95373566cd482cbd2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aed4ff8ec5ae7dd0b48d1b26",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "既然成了我的训练员，\r\n你应该做好觉悟了。\r\n请尽情发挥能力，别留下遗憾。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2fe3f5b6bfd0b445f4982598bc0da2150047a2e95a37a6e6289f4c37c9935aa0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69f9f25ef16546d70a33d16a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我所追求的并非是单纯的胜利。\r\n若无法留下鲜明又强烈的光芒，\r\n便称不上是家族的胜利……对吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "643768e176ce85bbe3d0a06c1e7e2f19562d38c6c3b31cb814182c2026bed2af",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55f42d433ddaf02b08069de0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你已经证明自己具备资格了。\r\n别恐惧、别害怕，\r\n只要致力于完成使命就好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4725366433e80730765b621dac7f23fc6a78285b6ba6e48cb75863116a398151",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de180e9aa73e3351e02b9cb3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夏季集训是个特别的环境。\r\n让我们完美运用，好好锻练吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "06c5fd5046ca94e80d6f3aefde427312b561cb48c9434f714d6d02fce1fe6d25",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df67d57b1687f4623b8833db",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "华丽地、轻盈地。\n让我们一同绽放辉煌。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc0e1e5791b037c0f3a9299140a94e7159d7e8ae62dd7126592bcd6ba3548f62",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2612726e64e78eb57e14ce24",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "并非只有那轰鸣咆哮的火焰\n才拥有热度……\n我将为此证明。",
      "source_fingerprint": "152640fb7b64a3509d31adbc4c96799872548bb3c85ab1be0a5cfaf5201fa5d6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a86c63596aee69803cffef96",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论在何种场合，都要展现出\n自己的存在感。像母亲大人那样……",
      "source_fingerprint": "940bf648443898f0cf40df8bc231dda922844750536d4f9ab46d2762c56dc689",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2deac86fe1a49e5ade68e473",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "足以吸引并魅惑众人的  \n能量……  \n我一定会掌握它。",
      "source_fingerprint": "30818fd01c2a3135827558de19dbe5805aadefea97d01c28fa63514ea0071e96",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5421c537f7bd13643e186ef1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……还远远称不上洗练呢。\n不满足于现状，不断磨炼的话，\n总有一天……",
      "source_fingerprint": "79a7666ae7b823fece9ee1b428d78d067d965d2da5a783e841b8e3c15b95201c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5cfdaa9d927aad65bf6902d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请不要忘记，如果想要将领先的位置\n托付给你，我们这边也需要有相应的觉悟。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b69fb622958698fe77313294411ac1e0c5b6de20c48be5aa22a5bd774082ec58",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a81b59bf21c10f0de069f5f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一族的玉条已铭刻在我身上。\n……您作为我的训练员，\n也请在心中铭刻信念。",
      "source_fingerprint": "971131563dfe86eb02fdc815f66116601b1630f7ba412f3f4879009836fe42ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:442d1fa66f26eda3059cf03e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "愿你的前途也充满光彩。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b0f5bf30ff059f5914474bcd0fd7ff920014bb68b4bb75c049f272f60055052",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:312af9ea1e1f70b8c91df4ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感谢你的鼎力相助。",
      "source_fingerprint": "724da46f4a98415403a189da285286fc43e710d8a0dd0599acb9fc1dbbf45372",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eee7cbfc78fd716567416fc1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "出色的护送表现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ac67b0e61ac516aa57e87d97c66a3af032a86aa60149c3bf97965bfb1cb9971",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:787954161f7acf484a84ad98",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的火焰不会燃尽……",
      "source_fingerprint": "c65b2ca6edccefff53744b74505263d3b795360e34fd126bebed066850519667",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3e06d7365821c05070813dd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我保证会拿出更加卓越的成果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cfb340fda36a25f412564a659b6a67f1093fe5a2ed181c1324b6f8f70d0f7f5d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00ac386ae58bb4026d819ff5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会绽放最耀眼的光芒。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6413057561673421f78ef67a2ea83d1a3bd4c3396addea89762ab8914db2b1b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4b6c734b9448ac7a5285483",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你好，我是第一红宝石。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f67c68eab278ac3a6f38ead5f350a08d417ef91e6686c1da15d2d4021f79115a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06abef170ddd36be78956e8c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "用深红的光芒为我们家族\r\n华丽的轨迹增添色彩吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "53745ba0269c493a648a6f5bf99bf168efe07f10fa3574c465f1c8289b72b4ad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3693d6af892d1b3af4291635",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "帮助他人也是我的职责。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6747d1726b041f1c5b14e62db38d7542ca98f68a37d20036e120327491148f7f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8089ed93dd6c248a1201e9b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想必能做更进一步的钻研。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b244d93957b7936c2b25c654c8031f3c762b7ba1639c64c13854a823f4d0b345",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a6f07e48abed649227c559eb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "犹如升向天空的火焰一般……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d6d2a9e28d5e71c72ed9c93ecad440da9f2b82b791e57d13e20dc560f7c8bf1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24349fe72b23cabc1b5687de",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让我们留下辉煌的灯火吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5b54bc6af221f3cf42a29d42f1296794cdf16300ef75019e1c44e36b87215bd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40790f92ea57181a3ffd4aa3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以玲珑剔透的青色火焰为傲，  \n将我的存在铭刻于世吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c50a8b82be53e6abe7a9f298212805abfff96c405407bb5b36a926edb6a760a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2db574ff6197ffc784a93b40",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是第一红宝石。来吧，请跟我来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "53e973ebf8a6c88abc7b7311158bd83af87536c223bb7a0a59926ec39e8060bd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0b8e4d4f298177faf664825",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "参りましょう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "550ae0cca8ce02f21c817336ea537feb3001ba9442ddf10f4fb8bbc3e372fb1b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7eacfddd63c39289d88e01ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "バーミリオン。\r\n…美しく発色してくれるかしら。",
      "source_fingerprint": "16afa43b27fdb03600d3ce6e59280fffb1c75ff7f0975960eaa184c8f36a3243",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dfa5f528dbd5043e5e568e1f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってくるわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e42824481b89139758cebcbc6de379bc2bfe391af6bc5931ce02cac1bdb2432",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:edd66d196175d727dfd97e21",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただいま。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3d9f2c221a037f0a2eb9da22145532ea4b422af42c29694227631ad74c073f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc0c8f83eb8682c9bf224335",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "貴方の愛…\r\nどうぞ、捧げてご覧なさいな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1d26c0d92b74c35da5bb9df84eeb3193f87fe61d50f4653df6b0492d3bba538",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48538d36e0af57d29c530e09",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "クロッキーのモデル。\r\nお願いしようかしら。\r\n…あのポーズ以外でね？",
      "source_fingerprint": "38d307c032d28596931cf8437fce98d35add81bea0a91da3bb19b09113b6c04d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:598c09a8c55ee15f344104dd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あけましておめでとうございます。\r\n今年もどうぞ、よろしく…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba7806197341d3a089d7b61252da3b03120d804ef45750ba973af8344ba2080c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f73dbe1d38797ea68a32bb0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "バレンタイン。\r\nそれで？",
      "source_fingerprint": "095f2cdf173dc71f2546abf6ee259bf88da78d45e831cbf49978e2db5f461c98",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91895ecce2776543d5ba148e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "チョコレートでよろしいの？\r\n欲がないのね。それとも…\r\n意気地がないのかしら。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6784e0965b6c152767a774f8c30c82c5f473d155891da14cc0462c578819127e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f2c1d2f1f089143586e516f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "短冊はアルダンに渡してくださる。\r\n願う権利は、あの子にあげるわ。\r\n私はもう…祈らないの。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a56788940cdbf63bfbb8677a174831229f87ac2652425472f29e3f5a143ca93b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:782ebb995f20a77279165e18",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "悪戯ね…。したいの？\r\nそれとも…してほしい？\r\nふふ、嫌よ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1166677a074dd8b2f62eb1b8815d793d2eed818c703e8135ae807cc171ae219e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ce918a78b6aeba9ee398163",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最初の挨拶はライアンだったわ。\r\nあの子たち、毎年メリークリスマス\r\nを言いに来るの…可愛いでしょう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4ea873d8e5beb4b428581dbc7a364c77847f44bcbaba1f2d2e1a6c0e1de1153",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d18fce768a3df9e69a989f07",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "貴方、正装に着替えてくださる。\r\nクリスマスパーティーに、\r\n顔を出したい気分なの。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4a394229c137ef712fa1e7d3449b2c95f36366707b0a0ca54fead83107686d4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1156c8068470d44c6832f758",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "勝ったわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e92953563f1bc8d5260d381b0b55f254d35e31966fd4a190044ea5d4d2fb6aa4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a7b5ffd8108aab5a10dea847",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "もうすぐ、また新しい年が始まる…\r\nどんなレースが待っているのか、\r\n期待して迎えましょう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a5eeb5a0fca8ce935e7497bede370d70a66595fc5094c5facb734030ae856edf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21decc728118834ac9583667",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ああ、誕生日ですのね。\r\nおめでとう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aff5875eab35bc290d8d0b8a58225046f6ed294df6d3ef5cac81746692ff7e5f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66c2f7423d4328d28c280012",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "おめでとう。…あら、\r\n誕生日じゃなかったかしら。\r\nお祝いの言葉を、贈りますわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4ee970bc924eec5eb2b039043b24eff0adaa6763a1b362e7c08c9bca6682b8b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bcd0f578b9a13a2a1cebb75e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "そうだ、貴方…アクセサリーを\r\n試してみたら。今日は家に、\r\nたくさん届くの…差し上げるわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8fc116d21444adeee5e68b6da1fd5dea4b58cae9dca67df8fadc01489c7e03b9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "10013"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
